732
00:59:05,125 --> 00:59:06,167
Put her through.

733
00:59:08,000 --> 00:59:10,832
<i>This is Commissioner Valladares.
How can I help?</i>

734
00:59:10,833 --> 00:59:12,416
M... M... Morning, sir.

735
00:59:12,417 --> 00:59:15,457
This is Isaura. I'm looking for Arturo.
Know where he is?

736
00:59:15,458 --> 00:59:19,417
Arturo is, uh, on special operations
so he'll be late getting home.

737
00:59:19,958 --> 00:59:22,998
Listen, you need to pick up your daughters
from school now and take 'em home.

738
00:59:23,750 --> 00:59:26,957
