739
00:59:26,958 --> 00:59:28,166
<i>Isaura, please,</i>

740
00:59:28,167 --> 00:59:30,916
<i>take the girls home
and wait for Arturo to get there.</i>

741
00:59:30,917 --> 00:59:33,000
