742
00:59:37,375 --> 00:59:38,667
Oh my God.

743
00:59:41,792 --> 00:59:43,875
Okay.

744
00:59:45,792 --> 00:59:47,000
Stay right here.

745
00:59:47,708 --> 00:59:49,292
I'll find out what's going on.

746
01:00:07,042 --> 01:00:09,083
You wife must be worried about you, right?

747
01:00:13,125 --> 01:00:16,500
I'm not in the mood to play your games,
so let's just sit here in silence, okay?

748
01:00:21,875 --> 01:00:24,249
I don't understand what makes you think

749
01:00:24,250 --> 01:00:26,417
that you'll be rewarded
for bringing me in.

750
01:00:27,000 --> 01:00:28,000
Huh?

751
01:00:28,667 --> 01:00:29,750
I already told you.

752
01:00:30,250 --> 01:00:34,458
I got everyone in your whole department
in my goddamn pocket, hombre!

753
01:00:36,583 --> 01:00:39,167
When will you stop playing dumb, Officer?

754
01:00:43,542 --> 01:00:46,458
You clearly care a lot
about your family, Carmona.

755
01:00:46,958 --> 01:00:49,250
And you'd probably
do anything for them, no?

756
01:00:50,750 --> 01:00:53,208
Everything I do, I do for my children.

757
01:00:54,458 --> 01:00:55,792
Now it's your turn.

758
01:00:56,333 --> 01:00:58,917
You need to do
what you need to do for them.

759
01:01:00,292 --> 01:01:02,852
If you don't accept the offer
I'm willing to give you, my friend,

760
01:01:03,333 --> 01:01:05,083
then someone else will, <i>cabrón.</i>

761
01:01:08,458 --> 01:01:10,917
So it might as well be you.

762
01:01:12,125 --> 01:01:13,750
So let's do it, Officer.

763
01:01:18,292 --> 01:01:20,292
Mm.

764
01:01:20,792 --> 01:01:23,249
Officer, can you pass me
a bottle of water?

765
01:01:23,250 --> 01:01:25,208
I'm... I'm really thirsty.

766
01:01:27,583 --> 01:01:30,125
It's just a bottle of water,
for fuck's sake.

767
01:01:46,375 --> 01:01:47,583
Don't be an idiot.

768
01:01:48,792 --> 01:01:50,000
You think you're slick?

769
01:01:52,042 --> 01:01:55,042
No. I just wanted to ask you
to open it for me.

770
01:01:56,042 --> 01:01:57,417
Come on, help me out.

771
01:01:58,167 --> 01:01:59,208
Pretty please?

772
01:02:43,458 --> 01:02:45,292
Hey, hey.

773
01:02:46,083 --> 01:02:47,292
Stay there.

774
01:03:39,833 --> 01:03:42,208
You're scared to death, aren't you?

775
01:03:42,792 --> 01:03:46,375
So this is your first time
being in deep shit like this.

776
01:03:47,167 --> 01:03:48,583
<i>Chingada madre!</i>

777
01:03:51,250 --> 01:03:53,624
We have units in these three sectors.

778
01:03:53,625 --> 01:03:54,874
This is where we are.

779
01:03:54,875 --> 01:03:56,874
Thanks to the information
from the sewer company,

780
01:03:56,875 --> 01:03:58,249
every drain is covered now.

781
01:03:58,250 --> 01:03:59,417
Understood.

782
01:04:01,583 --> 01:04:03,082
<i>Puta madre.</i>

783
01:04:03,083 --> 01:04:04,833
What if this fucker slipped away?

784
01:04:06,250 --> 01:04:08,292
He should have
come out of a storm drain by now.

785
01:04:26,500 --> 01:04:28,000
Go ahead, Admiral.

786
01:04:35,708 --> 01:04:36,708
Understood.

787
01:04:38,875 --> 01:04:40,625
-Foco!
-Sir.

788
01:04:42,167 --> 01:04:43,875
The Federal Police have El Cholo.

789
01:04:45,000 --> 01:04:46,792
And look at the prize they got.

790
01:04:50,292 --> 01:04:51,375
It's El Chapo, Commander.

791
01:04:54,792 --> 01:04:55,917
Venado!

792
01:04:58,792 --> 01:05:02,332
Get us the address of Motel del Puerto.
That's where the party's at.

793
01:05:02,333 --> 01:05:04,707
-Yes, sir.
-Let's move, everyone! To the motel!

794
01:05:04,708 --> 01:05:06,333
Let's go, marines!

795
01:05:36,917 --> 01:05:37,917
Gracias.

796
01:05:43,417 --> 01:05:46,208
-May God be with you.
-Thank you.

797
01:05:54,917 --> 01:05:56,542
Hurry up. Get in, get in.

798
01:06:23,750 --> 01:06:25,875
Boss! We got heat Incoming.

799
01:06:26,542 --> 01:06:28,417
<i>Chingada madre.</i>

800
01:06:34,375 --> 01:06:35,999
-Commander?
-What do you got?

801
01:06:36,000 --> 01:06:38,208
Seems like those assholes
might know where to go too.

802
01:06:41,583 --> 01:06:43,207
Think you're right, Foco.

803
01:06:43,208 --> 01:06:46,332
Hey, boys, you guys
can take care of those marines.

804
01:06:46,333 --> 01:06:48,042
We'll go on ahead to the motel.

805
01:06:52,417 --> 01:06:54,749
Captain, however this goes down,

806
01:06:54,750 --> 01:06:56,630
just keep following
anybody who tries to escape.

807
01:07:01,292 --> 01:07:03,499
-Split off and chase them down.
-Yes, sir!

808
01:07:03,500 --> 01:07:07,042
Don't let them get away! Step on it, Foco!

809
01:07:08,500 --> 01:07:10,541
Don't lose them, marine. Come on!

810
01:07:10,542 --> 01:07:12,500
We have to catch up to those assholes!

811
01:07:18,500 --> 01:07:19,999
Let's dance, <i>cabrónes!</i>

812
01:07:20,000 --> 01:07:21,499
Come on, let's go!

813
01:07:21,500 --> 01:07:23,499
We're going to fuck you up!

814
01:07:23,500 --> 01:07:24,500
Bring it on!

815
01:07:28,708 --> 01:07:31,416
-Put the guns down now!
-You first, <i>cabrón!</i>

816
01:07:31,417 --> 01:07:32,874
Put them down now!

817
01:07:32,875 --> 01:07:34,667
Hold your ground, <i>cabrónes!</i>

818
01:07:35,292 --> 01:07:36,500
Surrender now!

819
01:07:39,792 --> 01:07:44,000
Don't make me fucking say it again.
Everyone, put down your weapons now!

820
01:07:44,500 --> 01:07:45,958
There's nowhere to run.

821
01:07:46,708 --> 01:07:48,083
Fuck this!

822
01:07:49,500 --> 01:07:50,750
Okay, okay!

823
01:07:58,833 --> 01:07:59,833
Move in.

824
01:08:01,250 --> 01:08:02,333
Stay alert.

825
01:08:02,833 --> 01:08:05,041
-On the ground!
-Put your hands on the floor!

826
01:08:05,042 --> 01:08:07,832
-Show me your hands!
-Don't fucking try anything.

827
01:08:07,833 --> 01:08:10,458
That's it, motherfucker.
Keep your hands on your head.

828
01:08:14,792 --> 01:08:16,791
Uh, h... how are you doing, girls?

829
01:08:16,792 --> 01:08:19,417
What... What did you
take us out of school for, Mama?

830
01:08:26,042 --> 01:08:27,042
Come on.

831
01:08:34,833 --> 01:08:35,833
Come here.

832
01:08:39,250 --> 01:08:42,083
Go on. Run. Hurry. Come on, let's go.

833
01:08:42,625 --> 01:08:44,750
Get inside the house. I'll be right there.

834
01:09:14,417 --> 01:09:17,082
I didn't get to finish my lunch, Mama.
I'm still hungry!

835
01:09:17,083 --> 01:09:18,375
Oh, sweetie.

836
01:09:19,000 --> 01:09:21,416
Listen, girls, I need you
to go to your rooms

837
01:09:21,417 --> 01:09:23,124
and eat the rest of your lunch there.

838
01:09:23,125 --> 01:09:25,332
After that, pick out your favorite toy,

839
01:09:25,333 --> 01:09:27,542
and, um, I'll be there soon
to join you, okay?

840
01:09:30,417 --> 01:09:31,417
Go have fun.

841
01:09:31,917 --> 01:09:33,042
Love you both.

842
01:09:38,292 --> 01:09:42,375
Stop being irresponsible.
Think about the future of your kids.

843
01:09:43,500 --> 01:09:46,750
Do you know how many kids
I have? Fucking 18.

844
01:09:48,000 --> 01:09:51,249
And all of those kids
have everything they could ever need.

845
01:09:51,250 --> 01:09:52,416
You know why?

846
01:09:52,417 --> 01:09:54,999
It's because I can. Because of money.

847
01:09:55,000 --> 01:09:56,082
And with that money,

848
01:09:56,083 --> 01:09:59,916
I also provide for the countless kids
who were born with a gun in their hands

849
01:09:59,917 --> 01:10:01,374
instead of a bottle to drink.

850
01:10:01,375 --> 01:10:02,833
There's a shitload of those kids.

851
01:10:04,833 --> 01:10:07,542
Well, I'm not saying that I don't think
you've been a good provider.

852
01:10:09,000 --> 01:10:11,333
But those kids
that you claim to be helping?

853
01:10:13,917 --> 01:10:15,875
They're all just living on their knees.

854
01:10:16,583 --> 01:10:18,124
But they eat because of me.

855
01:10:18,125 --> 01:10:19,625
Right. You feed them.

856
01:10:22,958 --> 01:10:24,417
Then you make them kill.

857
01:10:26,167 --> 01:10:27,416
Then they end up dead.

858
01:10:27,417 --> 01:10:28,708
Ah, <i>chingá!</i>

859
01:10:29,208 --> 01:10:31,207
Don't policemen kill people too?

860
01:10:31,208 --> 01:10:33,666
Pretty much the same
if you think about it.

861
01:10:33,667 --> 01:10:35,666
The only difference
between your men and mine

862
01:10:35,667 --> 01:10:38,541
is that you guys
barely have enough to get by,

863
01:10:38,542 --> 01:10:40,875
and my men can't spend it fast enough.

864
01:10:41,708 --> 01:10:42,708
Huh.

865
01:10:45,042 --> 01:10:46,542
Doesn't sound too bad.

866
01:10:47,375 --> 01:10:48,375
So, Carmona,

867
01:10:49,958 --> 01:10:51,667
how many people have you killed?

868
01:11:13,208 --> 01:11:15,750
Enough, <i>cabrón!</i>
Get me the fuck out of here! Come on!

869
01:11:16,958 --> 01:11:19,457
Can't you just tell me
what the fuck you want, <i>cabrón?!</i>

870
01:11:19,458 --> 01:11:22,749
-Ask for whatever you want, <i>puto!</i>
-Sit down. Fucking sit!

871
01:11:22,750 --> 01:11:24,750
-Don't be a fucking...
-Sit your ass down!

872
01:11:35,208 --> 01:11:36,333
Listen, Officer.

873
01:11:36,917 --> 01:11:39,583
I know I'm fucked,
and the boss might be fucked, too,

874
01:11:40,083 --> 01:11:42,791
but don't forget
about how this is gonna play out for you.

875
01:11:42,792 --> 01:11:46,167
I'm gonna murder your entire family,
one by one, in front of you, <i>cabrón.</i>

876
01:11:47,458 --> 01:11:49,250
You really think anyone has your back?

877
01:11:49,750 --> 01:11:52,375
No one's gonna save you.
You're on your own!

878
01:11:53,125 --> 01:11:54,582
Go fuck yourself.

879
01:11:54,583 --> 01:11:56,041
You can put me in a fucking prison,

880
01:11:56,042 --> 01:11:58,417
but once I get in,
I'm gonna put a million on your head.

881
01:12:01,458 --> 01:12:03,458
What makes you think
you'll actually make it there?

882
01:12:04,667 --> 01:12:05,750
Who knows you're here?

883
01:12:06,250 --> 01:12:07,542
It's only me.

884
01:12:08,250 --> 01:12:11,708
And you have no fucking idea
how much I wanna blow your brains out.

885
01:12:12,208 --> 01:12:15,125
So just keep mouthing off, and you'll...

886
01:12:20,292 --> 01:12:22,666
Took you guys long enough.
Where the hell were you?

887
01:12:22,667 --> 01:12:25,750
This is Commander Carmona's
patrol car, right?

888
01:12:29,750 --> 01:12:31,125
Answer me, <i>cabrón!</i>

889
01:12:32,917 --> 01:12:35,958
They were able
to get the boss too! El Chapo!

890
01:12:39,792 --> 01:12:40,792
Rosales?

891
01:12:41,792 --> 01:12:43,749
The fuck are you doing
all the way out here?

892
01:12:43,750 --> 01:12:44,749
Barraza?

893
01:12:44,750 --> 01:12:45,833
Yes, dumbass!

894
01:12:51,208 --> 01:12:52,833
<i>Pinche,</i> Barraza!

895
01:12:53,333 --> 01:12:55,500
Jesus, you scared the shit outta me, man.

896
01:12:56,000 --> 01:12:58,541
So wait, how long you been in Mochis?

897
01:12:58,542 --> 01:13:00,458
Three days, <i>cabrón.</i>

898
01:13:01,542 --> 01:13:02,958
-Fuck!
-And you?

899
01:13:03,583 --> 01:13:06,042
Man, it smells
like you haven't showered in weeks.

900
01:13:06,542 --> 01:13:08,332
Shit, that's because I've been undercover.

901
01:13:08,333 --> 01:13:11,293
Well, you guys are fucking precious, yeah?
Enough with the fucking reunion!

902
01:13:13,792 --> 01:13:15,708
What the hell do we do, <i>cabrón?</i>

903
01:13:16,417 --> 01:13:18,333
If his men get here before ours do,

904
01:13:18,875 --> 01:13:20,375
we might as well be dead, <i>guey.</i>

905
01:13:21,542 --> 01:13:22,958
We'll be ready.

906
01:13:25,333 --> 01:13:26,542
-Good luck.
-Yeah.

907
01:13:36,000 --> 01:13:38,958
Okay, marine, don't lose him now.
Keep close.

908
01:13:42,875 --> 01:13:44,083
Goddamn it!

909
01:13:45,083 --> 01:13:47,500
We gotta lose those motherfuckers
before we get to the motel.

910
01:13:48,917 --> 01:13:50,875
Step on it, man. They're right on our ass!

911
01:14:02,750 --> 01:14:03,750
Get ready, Foco.

912
01:14:04,750 --> 01:14:06,542
The shitstorm's about to begin.

913
01:14:08,917 --> 01:14:13,083
Fuck it, stop the car, man. Let's just
fucking square up with these marines.

914
01:14:15,583 --> 01:14:17,374
Stick with them. We're close.

915
01:14:17,375 --> 01:14:20,042
-Are you sure, boss?
-Stop the damn car.

916
01:14:21,125 --> 01:14:22,125
Okay, sir.

917
01:14:25,625 --> 01:14:28,874
-What's up, assholes? Fucking want some?!
-Take cover!

918
01:14:28,875 --> 01:14:32,124
I swear to God,
I'm gonna kill all you motherfuckers!

919
01:14:32,125 --> 01:14:34,041
-Take cover!
-Get down!

920
01:14:34,042 --> 01:14:36,332
Come at me, assholes!
Suck my fucking dick!

921
01:14:36,333 --> 01:14:38,792
I got you. Stay down!

922
01:14:39,708 --> 01:14:41,666
Press forward when they reload!

923
01:14:41,667 --> 01:14:44,667
I'm gonna cut your heads off,
<i>hijos de puta!</i>

924
01:14:46,333 --> 01:14:49,041
-Foco, Vaquero, move in, left flank!
-Sir!

925
01:14:49,042 --> 01:14:50,292
Reload!

926
01:14:50,833 --> 01:14:52,042
Puma, Black Charro! On me!

927
01:14:53,792 --> 01:14:55,917
-Fuck.
-Fuck you, pigs!

928
01:14:57,042 --> 01:14:58,708
Counterattack! Go!

929
01:15:09,583 --> 01:15:11,000
Fuck you, jarheads!

930
01:15:11,917 --> 01:15:12,917
Grenade!

931
01:15:21,250 --> 01:15:24,333
You're not gonna get anything
for turning me in, Carmona.

932
01:15:25,625 --> 01:15:27,292
And you'll be fucked if you do.

933
01:15:27,833 --> 01:15:30,124
Come on. You know how it is over there.

934
01:15:30,125 --> 01:15:34,249
The government or the DEA
will make you and your family disappear.

935
01:15:34,250 --> 01:15:37,916
Because then they can blame it on me,
and give me a longer sentence.

936
01:15:37,917 --> 01:15:39,291
'Cause that's what they do.

937
01:15:39,292 --> 01:15:41,000
You know I'm right.

938
01:15:41,583 --> 01:15:44,458
Listen, I'm giving you my word.

939
01:15:46,083 --> 01:15:48,916
Just take me to Che Ríos
and I'll give you ten million.

940
01:15:48,917 --> 01:15:50,167
Fifteen.

941
01:15:53,125 --> 01:15:54,291
You promised 15.

942
01:15:54,292 --> 01:15:55,499
Ah, that was before.

943
01:15:55,500 --> 01:15:57,667
But if we get there today, I promise you,

944
01:15:58,167 --> 01:16:01,042
I'll have my men waiting there
with ten million in cash.

945
01:16:03,333 --> 01:16:05,292
You think you can buy me off?

946
01:16:07,417 --> 01:16:08,417
Not me.

947
01:16:10,250 --> 01:16:12,375
You don't have all of us in your pocket.

948
01:16:17,167 --> 01:16:20,083
You think you're a good person,
like you're a saint, don't you?

949
01:16:22,292 --> 01:16:24,958
I had to kill a kid
who was selling your shit,

950
01:16:25,875 --> 01:16:28,333
and two innocent people died that day.

951
01:16:30,083 --> 01:16:31,500
Because we're at war.

952
01:16:33,708 --> 01:16:37,542
And civilians end up dying as collateral
in the crossfire.

953
01:16:38,208 --> 01:16:42,083
Because of people like you,
who murder and poison society.

954
01:16:42,583 --> 01:16:45,667
I don't understand how someone like you
can even sleep at night.

955
01:16:46,375 --> 01:16:47,542
Seriously.

956
01:16:49,042 --> 01:16:52,041
And you think that if you just keep
building chapels you're forgiven?

957
01:16:52,042 --> 01:16:53,208
Fuck off!

958
01:16:55,000 --> 01:16:58,375
I can't wait to put you away
so I can watch you rot in that cell.

959
01:17:02,458 --> 01:17:04,292
But if I can't put you in jail...

960
01:17:07,208 --> 01:17:08,542
then I'll put you in the ground.

961
01:17:46,667 --> 01:17:47,708
The girls.

962
01:17:50,333 --> 01:17:51,500
Come on, move it!

963
01:17:52,833 --> 01:17:54,124
Is that Papa?

964
01:17:54,125 --> 01:17:55,999
What's wrong? Who's outside?

965
01:17:56,000 --> 01:17:58,374
-Come here. Shh.
-I'm getting scared, mama.

966
01:17:58,375 --> 01:18:00,791
Don't worry, girls.
Dad will be here soon, I promise.

967
01:18:00,792 --> 01:18:03,707
-Who's outside?
-Shh, shh. Let's lower our voices.

968
01:18:03,708 --> 01:18:05,541
-We're gonna be fine.
-I'm scared.

969
01:18:05,542 --> 01:18:07,207
-Shh.
-Where is Papa?

970
01:18:07,208 --> 01:18:08,957
TWO TRUCKS FULL OF HITMEN
CAME TO THE HOUSE.

971
01:18:08,958 --> 01:18:10,416
Answer me, Arturo.

972
01:18:10,417 --> 01:18:11,875
THE THREE OF US ARE HERE.

973
01:18:25,958 --> 01:18:27,042
This can't be happening.

974
01:18:35,042 --> 01:18:36,207
-Where's Papa?
-Arturo!

975
01:18:36,208 --> 01:18:37,291
Isa!

976
01:18:37,292 --> 01:18:39,833
Arturo, there are two trucks outside
and they're...

977
01:18:41,625 --> 01:18:42,666
Hey!

978
01:18:42,667 --> 01:18:44,082
No! Please, please, don't shoot!

979
01:18:44,083 --> 01:18:46,332
You assholes get the fuck out of my house!

980
01:18:46,333 --> 01:18:48,624
-Please, sir, please!
-Who are they, Mama?

981
01:18:48,625 --> 01:18:50,291
Leave them alone!

982
01:18:50,292 --> 01:18:52,708
Sounds like they already made it inside.

983
01:18:54,542 --> 01:18:55,542
<i>Please!</i>

984
01:18:56,333 --> 01:18:57,999
<i>Please don't kill us!</i>

985
01:18:58,000 --> 01:18:59,207
Tell them to stand down.

986
01:18:59,208 --> 01:19:00,541
Tell them to back off!

987
01:19:00,542 --> 01:19:02,041
<i>No! Please, please!</i>

988
01:19:02,042 --> 01:19:04,375
Say it! Tell your guys to let them go!

989
01:19:08,708 --> 01:19:09,708
<i>Please!</i>

990
01:19:11,458 --> 01:19:13,582
How did you think this was going to end?

991
01:19:13,583 --> 01:19:14,791
<i>Mama, I'm scared.</i>

992
01:19:14,792 --> 01:19:18,542
I told you. This is what
you get for playing the hero, <i>cabrón.</i>

993
01:19:19,333 --> 01:19:22,249
They're my daughters, man.
They're just little kids!

994
01:19:22,250 --> 01:19:23,582
<i>No, don't shoot!</i>

995
01:19:23,583 --> 01:19:25,832
-They're gonna keep screaming for help.
-<i>Please!</i>

996
01:19:25,833 --> 01:19:27,375
And there's nothing you can do.

997
01:19:34,875 --> 01:19:36,000
-<i>Please!</i>
-Isa!

998
01:19:36,583 --> 01:19:38,541
Isa, are you there?

999
01:19:38,542 --> 01:19:40,374
Please!

1000
01:19:40,375 --> 01:19:42,166
We didn't do anything.

1001
01:19:42,167 --> 01:19:43,457
Are you there?

1002
01:19:43,458 --> 01:19:47,082
Shush. Please don't hurt them!
They're just kids, so please don't.

1003
01:19:47,083 --> 01:19:48,125
Can you...

1004
01:20:01,708 --> 01:20:04,167
Now I'm going
to fucking kill you, motherfucker!

1005
01:20:04,667 --> 01:20:06,542
Drop your gun, Officer!

1006
01:20:07,750 --> 01:20:09,082
You're fucking dead, <i>puto!</i>

1007
01:20:09,083 --> 01:20:12,123
-I need you to calm down, Officer!
-I'm gonna fucking blow your brains out!

1008
01:20:13,042 --> 01:20:16,041
Stand down! I'm giving you an order
as the vice admiral!

1009
01:20:16,042 --> 01:20:18,207
I swear I'm gonna
fucking blow your brains out!

1010
01:20:18,208 --> 01:20:19,458
Put it down, Officer.

1011
01:20:41,417 --> 01:20:44,583
<i>Arturo! We're okay.</i>

1012
01:20:55,042 --> 01:20:57,417
Don't look!

1013
01:21:04,458 --> 01:21:06,875
The... The Army got to us. We're okay.

1014
01:21:21,000 --> 01:21:23,500
Your six-month vacation is over, Chapo.

1015
01:21:24,208 --> 01:21:25,208
Yeah.

1016
01:21:26,708 --> 01:21:27,708
I'm done.

1017
01:21:33,667 --> 01:21:34,917
Piece of shit!

1018
01:21:35,417 --> 01:21:38,167
Okay, okay, you got him. Now relax.

1019
01:21:39,500 --> 01:21:40,500
Escort him out.

1020
01:21:41,000 --> 01:21:43,083
Let me go. Don't touch me.

1021
01:21:45,750 --> 01:21:46,750
Marines!

1022
01:21:50,375 --> 01:21:54,083
At this moment, you are at the disposal
of the Mexican Naval Forces.

1023
01:21:55,208 --> 01:21:57,208
I got your buddy waiting for you.

1024
01:21:58,125 --> 01:21:59,917
That is, if he's still alive.

1025
01:22:01,208 --> 01:22:02,292
Orders, sir?

1026
01:22:03,458 --> 01:22:04,583
Bring him out!

1027
01:22:12,667 --> 01:22:15,000
Mexican Army! Surrender!

1028
01:22:15,500 --> 01:22:17,749
Hurry up! Everyone, on the ground!

1029
01:22:17,750 --> 01:22:19,958
Hands behind your head.
Give us your weapons!

1030
01:22:20,458 --> 01:22:22,000
Come on, hurry up! All of you!

1031
01:22:26,792 --> 01:22:29,750
-Keep that clear.
-Two over there, three over here.

1032
01:22:33,875 --> 01:22:35,333
We got you guys a present.

1033
01:22:36,667 --> 01:22:37,792
Rot in hell.

1034
01:22:39,042 --> 01:22:40,375
All right, copy that.

1035
01:22:42,792 --> 01:22:45,042
-Are you okay?
-I'm fine, sir.

1036
01:22:47,250 --> 01:22:48,250
Well done, Carmona.

1037
01:22:49,000 --> 01:22:50,457
You've nothing to worry about.

1038
01:22:50,458 --> 01:22:53,500
Your family and your house
will be under the protection of the Army.

1039
01:22:54,250 --> 01:22:56,167
-Thanks.
-Hello, gentlemen.

1040
01:22:57,292 --> 01:22:58,958
Vice Admiral Ortega.

1041
01:22:59,708 --> 01:23:02,208
Officers, thanks for your cooperation.

1042
01:23:03,042 --> 01:23:04,125
Commissioner,

1043
01:23:05,125 --> 01:23:08,250
get your men out of here
as soon as possible. For your own safety.

1044
01:23:08,750 --> 01:23:12,125
From this point on, the Navy
will take these two into their custody.

1045
01:23:20,667 --> 01:23:21,666
What are you doing?

1046
01:23:21,667 --> 01:23:24,457
Stand down! Stand down. Hold your fire.

1047
01:23:24,458 --> 01:23:27,249
-Put your fucking guns down!
-Hold fire. Stand down.

1048
01:23:27,250 --> 01:23:28,332
Hold your fire.

1049
01:23:28,333 --> 01:23:30,749
-Soldier.
-Put your guns down!

1050
01:23:30,750 --> 01:23:32,500
-Relax!
-Come on.

1051
01:23:33,000 --> 01:23:36,833
It was the Federal Police, not the Navy,
who captured Joaquin Guzmán.

1052
01:23:37,500 --> 01:23:40,957
So we're all gonna go together
to the presidential hangar to report it.

1053
01:23:40,958 --> 01:23:41,958
Are we clear?

1054
01:23:50,958 --> 01:23:51,957
Marines!

1055
01:23:51,958 --> 01:23:53,208
Yes, sir!

1056
01:23:54,500 --> 01:23:56,041
Put your weapons down!

1057
01:23:56,042 --> 01:23:57,125
Yes, sir!

1058
01:23:57,750 --> 01:24:00,208
<i>Federales,</i> lower your weapons!

1059
01:24:02,667 --> 01:24:04,666
-Marines!
-Yes, sir!

1060
01:24:04,667 --> 01:24:06,583
-Escort them out!
-Yes, sir!

1061
01:24:10,667 --> 01:24:12,042
Well done, boys.

1062
01:24:22,792 --> 01:24:29,625
{\an8}JANUARY 8, 201610:32 AM
LOS MOCHIS, SINALOA

1063
01:24:50,292 --> 01:24:51,292
You good?

1064
01:24:51,833 --> 01:24:52,958
Yeah, I'm good.

1065
01:24:54,000 --> 01:24:56,957
Those marine assholes
were trying to take all of the credit.

1066
01:24:56,958 --> 01:25:00,042
Doesn't matter to me
who takes the credit for it.

1067
01:25:02,708 --> 01:25:05,249
I just worry about the Army
keeping their word to us.

1068
01:25:05,250 --> 01:25:08,042
No, don't say that, Carmona.
They'll protect us.

1069
01:25:08,542 --> 01:25:10,375
I'm a year from retirement, man.

1070
01:25:12,417 --> 01:25:13,417
<i>Cabrón.</i>

1071
01:25:15,417 --> 01:25:18,542
-The hell are you doing here?
-I could ask you the same thing.

1072
01:25:19,042 --> 01:25:20,750
I can't believe you're here, <i>cabrón.</i>

1073
01:25:21,500 --> 01:25:23,292
What a fucking mess you two got into.

1074
01:25:24,000 --> 01:25:25,542
You actually got El Chapo!

1075
01:25:26,333 --> 01:25:27,333
Fucking crazy.

1076
01:25:27,833 --> 01:25:31,625
Well, my boy Barraza here,
thanks to him, we got El Cholo.

1077
01:25:33,125 --> 01:25:34,416
Well, thanks then.

1078
01:25:34,417 --> 01:25:35,707
Any time.

1079
01:25:35,708 --> 01:25:38,083
Well, I've got somebody
waiting for me, huh?

1080
01:25:40,208 --> 01:25:41,375
Go get her, man!

1081
01:25:47,167 --> 01:25:48,750
-Sheesh.
-<i>Cabrón.</i>

1082
01:25:50,917 --> 01:25:52,582
-Glad you're my partner.
-Me too.

1083
01:25:52,583 --> 01:25:53,667
Thank you.

1084
01:25:56,208 --> 01:25:58,708
-We're fucking idiots, aren't we?
-Oh, complete idiots.

1085
01:26:04,000 --> 01:26:09,792
IN JULY 2019, JOAQUÍN GUZMÁN LOERA
WAS SENTENCED TO LIFE PLUS 30 YEARS.

1086
01:26:10,583 --> 01:26:14,166
"EL CHOLO" IVÁN GASTÉLUM
WAS EXTRADITED TO THE USA

1087
01:26:14,167 --> 01:26:18,042
FOR DRUG TRAFFICKING AND FIREARM CRIMES.

1088
01:26:21,042 --> 01:26:22,832
CARMONA WAS PROMOTED
AND COMMENDED.

1089
01:26:22,833 --> 01:26:24,957
HE WAS ASSIGNED
TO A SECURITY DETAIL OVERSEAS.

1090
01:26:24,958 --> 01:26:27,166
CARMONA AND HIS FAMILY
THEN RETURNED TO MEXICO.

1091
01:26:27,167 --> 01:26:29,042
HIS WHEREABOUTS
AND IDENTITY REMAIN CLASSIFIED.

1092
01:26:31,458 --> 01:26:33,374
HÉCTOR ROSALES WAS DECORATED
FOR HIS BRAVERY

1093
01:26:33,375 --> 01:26:35,082
AND ASSIGNED OVERSEAS WITH CARMONA.

1094
01:26:35,083 --> 01:26:36,957
HE DECIDED TO POSTPONE HIS RETIREMENT.

1095
01:26:36,958 --> 01:26:39,292
HIS WHEREABOUTS
AND IDENTITY REMAIN CLASSIFIED.
